{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-10-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>現年37歲的前TVB小花陳渃晴（前名：陳亭嘉），近日在社交平台自爆多年前在「舊公司」工作期間，曾遭遇恐怖的「潛規則」經歷。她透露一名「鹹濕導演」不但藉故對她毛手毛腳，更以角色作利誘，在被她斷然拒絕後，竟惱羞成怒當場對她粗口問候，並在事後全面封殺其工作機會。</p>\n<h2>陳渃晴指鹹濕導演已鋃鐺入獄</h2>\n<p>事件的導火線源於陳渃晴看到一則關於圈中人因猥褻罪被判入獄的新聞，有感而發寫道：「昨晚同人傾開計先知，原來慶功宴摸大髀係告得入。」這則新聞勾起了她深埋多年的慘痛回憶。她隨即在限時動態中詳述經過：「果陣喺舊公司真係俾鹹濕導演摸過大髀，然後仲同我講有套劇搵角色，仲話『你明嫁啦』，我話唔明，佢就粗口問候我。」陳渃晴憶述，當時她因拒絕配合對方，即時遭到該名導演的言語羞辱及打壓：「之後喺公司嘅日子，就無拍過嗰個導演嘅劇。」所幸天網恢恢，她表示多年後得知該名導演終因其他案件鋃鐺入獄，讓她不禁感慨：「所以我好確信，佢真係好鹹濕，早知當年早啲送佢一程。」</p>\n<img alt=\"前TVB小花陳渃晴一向不吝嗇晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44ff2e271c5f804fb38bed54f2ce5a99/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1784968457_3948923676708036379_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴IG有很多性感泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b531debaae7e0a96911a8e0e0aaa69aa/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1787756809_3972311710102875081_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴去完旅行，隨即分享比堅尼泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0f5278748bb0a99d69ac297f88c57d2/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1787303032_3968506073329821944_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴（左）與李君妍參加HYROX比賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab0bc73301ed9d6883fdb0cc131d2073/2026-10/SaveClip_App_792584940_18618367549024751_1621750859003915404_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"已為兩子之母的陳渃晴保養得宜，經常大方展示其驕人火辣身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a66d0b7f9bea281e6da3c7a0fa1f58bf/2026-10/SaveClip_App_813020672_18622542538024751_994337915059905680_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴到啟德欣賞足球比賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4151c26d147bf1014eac90e63ea607e/2026-10/SaveClip_App_828895607_18628038313024751_7884478854063949608_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴闊太生活好寫意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfdc07b0e54721bb78ad8300464ca239/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1786200309_3959256951401912859_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴再度分享泳照，可見她穿上三點式泳裝騎在巨型粉紅鶴浮床上，於泳池中飄盪並擺出寫意Pose。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4966adcf04ba385f6fa2382a0d06364d/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1788505324_3978592142566039969_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴是第24期無綫電視藝員訓練班學員，畢業後加入TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/977c2d6178fb9a512419598df5078828/2025-06/kaka_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴曾是TVB小花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d5afd498a0ae2f352cad654950e704f/2025-06/kaka_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴星運平平，未見有代表作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5733ea764c5f43219c20319e1fb4e716/2024-10/KAKA_61_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴嫁入豪門生活無憂，早前曾分享性感照賀結婚10周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/641b1a8e94384e7e38eb8d2dc3ccac63/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781508939_3919898927512297211_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴與餐飲才俊老公Joe Wong迎來結婚10周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a0c9c06ac8bfdf7c22b619a405be965/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781508939_3919898934390841904_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴與老公特意前往馬爾代夫享受二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1403748516a4f0b1c4c7fce690b229e3/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781508939_3919898940665704741_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴於TVB長做閒角離巢後一度彈起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27b7d230f230783a6a4b621c2559a4cf/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1762610116_3761368737971928571_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴近年已成為KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8898e722c12c1f2e304eede88414e294/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1768054959_3807043388450236067_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴熱愛運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb17cc0de3d47615bd8288b58f8ae711/2024-10/266501125_1056958578436832_1590910042607183712_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴動靜皆宜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f767e4f7286ae2aedb965b5ad323a16/2024-10/KAKA_98_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴偶然會參與跳舞工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bee6777089e903ac0f6006f87526de2/2024-10/KAKA_99_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳渃晴離巢後轉型當KOL</h2>\n<p>陳渃晴於2010年畢業於無綫電視第24期藝員訓練班，效力4年間大多飾演不起眼的閒角，星途平平。2014年她決心離開TVB尋求突破，並於2018年參加ViuTV真人騷《Good Night Show 廣告女皇》成功打入十強，憑藉惹火身材成功入屋。近年她轉型成為KOL，憑藉火辣形象和時尚觸覺，深受廣告商青睞，事業更上一層樓，吸金力驚人。</p>\n<h2>陳渃晴嫁餐飲才俊老公</h2>\n<p>陳渃晴的家庭生活亦相當美滿，她於2016年與餐飲才俊老公Joe Wong結婚後，誕下兩名兒子，一家四口現居於獨立屋，過著幸福的闊太生活。雖然已是兩子之母，但她對身材管理從不鬆懈，經常在社交平台分享性感美照，其保養得宜的狀態更勝從前，自信地展示出完美曲線，近日她分享當年的慘痛經歷，不少粉絲戥她心痛。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴曾效力TVB，不過演的角色相當不起眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/526f0f318cb700043e7e19d35e7b3fe2/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1771849246_3838871437399280749_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴離開TVB後，曾參加ViuTV節目《Good Night Show 廣告女皇》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67a4675235caa36b7a2e22fdf7ee8d13/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1773550724_3853144578522829474_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴現身ViuTV節目《Good Night Show 廣告女皇》一度引起討論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36d5faed187ddafa11b6c2dd7d107d43/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1773897137_3856050399338515343_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴婚後生了兩個小朋友，但身材仍非常好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/421fb3c4803035d56e480ae154c64609/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1777015648_3882209152718835068_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴老公是生意人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08e89ad6ffb3e628b324c6aa85f79c1a/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1778080991_3891145715221736380_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴婚後生活無憂，住豪宅之外，更時常吃喝玩樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd25c4e702f8225abdd8b1d24a30edb0/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781365635_3918700102256770372_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴在綜藝節目《千奇百趣高B班》擔任助手「粉刷」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/474594c66d6c88d9e2fe08b6309e9c71/2024-10/cap_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴（左）在綜藝節目《千奇百趣高B班》擔任助手，較為人有印象。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52bd624dbdd36a82bf22fea17c6fa4a1/2024-10/cap_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴2014年離開TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1e33fcd2189bc95bd96904ba8ee7beb/2025-06/kaka_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴曾亮相HOY TV節目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/346354d3799d884170a6df2596a6253e/2024-10/KAKA_111_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴近年轉型做KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edcc3a3d843202b27ba1f35ffc2d3a1b/2024-10/KAKA_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴推廣瑜伽發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2cf161320a0b9fccfc4ea33ffb8fd8a/2024-10/KAKA_52_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴婚後過得富貴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6830f22e1c45848d063e68e6c714209/2024-10/KAKA_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴經常度假。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1a55e7413ee1ec0b49580cb57209581/2024-10/KAKA_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴有一雙長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73bdba23f95c572a32354fa963f1b781/2024-10/KAKA_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴身材好澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d47b7deabd8507db36ff858285eb969/2024-10/KAKA_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴毫不吝惜晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37e71d399ebb4d279770b6bb83a1a5f9/2024-10/KAKA_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴的IG有大量水著相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/705793c33c0327969848166c2f9b4b4d/2024-10/KAKA_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴身材很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b61f72544fd1bc13f5ce15e1d5bc584/2024-10/KAKA_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴經常去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6ed6fa6b3f13d77c167134eef183d2b/2024-10/KAKA_19_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.012868+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":782,"images":39,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}